 "plan": {
  "angle": "The ranking pages are printable makeup consultation sheets and salon intake templates. This page shows the makeup consultation form as a working booking step: four consultations a makeup artist would recognize, each with the answers it collects and what the app does with them, from a bride's trial request set 6 weeks before her wedding to a headshot day where 3 staff still owe answers.",
  "tab_stories": [
   "Delphine Trask books Cecily Aubert for her October 17 wedding, answers with a 3 pm outdoor ceremony, 4 people getting makeup, dry skin and 3 inspiration photos, and the app sets her trial request for September 5, 6 weeks before.",
   "Yusra Dhillon books a 90-minute lesson at Sabatini Makeup Studio to learn a 10-minute work look, lists the 6 products she already owns, and Nell Sabatini plans the lesson around them.",
   "Greer Nakashima answers yes to a past reaction to lash glue on the Calloway Ridge Beauty Bar form, so the app emails lead artist Orla Pemberton and holds the booking as Needs review.",
   "Lio Ferraro does makeup for a June 12 headshot day at Bexley Ward Architects; 11 of 14 staff have answered by June 10, and the app emails a reminder to the other 3."
  ],
  "openers": [
